---
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import SideContact from '../components/SideContact.astro';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { NAP, GA_ID } from '../data/site';
---
<Base
  title="Privacy Policy | CA S. A. Abdul Rahim"
  description="Privacy policy for casaabdulrahim.in: no tracking cookies, no forms, no advertising. How the map, phone, WhatsApp and email links work."
  path="/privacy/"
  crumbs={[{ name: 'Privacy', path: '/privacy/' }]}
>
  <PageHero crumbs={[{ name: 'Privacy', path: '/privacy/' }]} h1={"Privacy policy"} lead={GA_ID ? "This website does not use advertising or tracking pixels and has no contact forms. Google Analytics cookies are used only if you accept them." : "This website does not use advertising, tracking pixels or analytics cookies, and it has no contact forms. It does not collect your personal data."} />
  <div class="wrap layout">
  <article class="prose">
    <h2 id="cookies">Cookies and browser storage</h2>
    {GA_ID ? (<p>This website uses Google Analytics 4 to count visits and see which pages are read. Google Analytics sets cookies and receives your IP address and basic device and page information, which Google processes under its own privacy policy. It loads only if you choose Accept in the cookie notice; if you choose Decline, or make no choice, it does not load. You can change your choice at any time with the Cookie settings link at the foot of every page. Analytics data is used only to improve this website and is not used for advertising.</p>) : (<p>This website sets no cookies of its own.</p>)}
    <p>The calculators save the figures you enter, and any scenarios you save, in your own browser (local storage) so that they are still there when you come back. This data stays on your device, is never sent to the office or any server, and can be removed with the Reset button in a calculator or by clearing your browser's site data. A calculator link you choose to share carries the figures in the link itself.</p>
    <h2>Google Maps</h2>
    <p>The contact, home and areas pages show an embedded Google Map. When the map loads, Google may set cookies and receive your IP address under Google's own privacy policy. You can avoid this by using the address shown in text instead.</p>
    <h2>Phone, WhatsApp and email</h2>
    <p>The Call and WhatsApp buttons open your phone's dialer or the WhatsApp app. Any message you send on WhatsApp is handled by WhatsApp under its own terms. The email link opens your own email app. Emails to enquiry@casaabdulrahim.in are read only by the office and used only to reply to you. Please do not send passwords or full bank details by WhatsApp or email.</p>
    <h2>Hosting</h2>
    <p>The website is hosted on Vercel. Vercel processes standard request data such as IP address for security and delivery.</p>
    <h2>Information you share with the office</h2>
    <p>Documents you share with the office for professional work are kept confidential as required by the Code of Ethics of the Institute of Chartered Accountants of India and applicable law, including the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>{NAP.name}, {NAP.addressLine}. Phone <a href={`tel:${NAP.phoneTel}`}>{NAP.phone}</a>.</p>
    <p class="meta">Last reviewed: <time datetime="2026-10-29">29 October 2026</time>. Source: <a href="https://www.meity.gov.in/" rel="noopener">Ministry of Electronics and Information Technology (meity.gov.in)</a>.</p>
  </article>
  <div class="sidebar"><SideContact /></div>
  </div>
</Base>
